hecking Your Understanding ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to check to see if you understand correctly, you can use different phrases.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Did you say ... ? <br>I don't quite understand.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you mean ... ? <br>Could you say that again, please?<br>Could you repeat that please? <br>Could you give me an example?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Did you understand my question?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I understood very well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I didn't understand you.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gemstone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a jewel or precious stone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They sold gemstones in the markets.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about Cairo.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "artisan ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who does skilled work with their hands ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The artisans made wonderful things to sell to tourists.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "floral", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looking  like flowers ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They decorated with beautiful floral ornaments.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "screened ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "covered or blocked from view ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The screened window had a be