they created these screened windows and decorative wood ceiling. It is a pleasant place to sit and relax.", "id": 2, "time": "29000", "image": "engenn5le11ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: This is the Northern Cemetery. The Mamluk sultans built this place for the dead. People with no homes came to share the mausoleums. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't quite understand.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: They lived here. They brought in electricity and established a post office. Even today the living and the dead share this cemetery.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Fascinating!", "id": 3, "time": "54500", "image": "engenn5le11ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le11ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le11ob07re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}